Package: ooborder
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Description: PANEL BORDER
 Wraps stdin text blocks inside configurable border frames with titles.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
